---
import MBPRLayout from "../layouts/MBPRLayout.astro";
---
<MBPRLayout title="About | Mission Bay Puppy Rescue" description="Learn the story behind Mission Bay Puppy Rescue, a San Diego non-profit dog and puppy rescue.">
<section class="page-intro">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">The Humans Behind The Puppies</span>
    <h1>About Mission Bay Puppy Rescue</h1>
    <p class="lede">The story is interesting &mdash; here it is, without the scroll.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tight">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="content-flow">
      <span class="eyebrow">How It All Started</span>
      <h2>It Began With 10 Puppies On Our Front Lawn</h2>
      <p class="lede">30 years ago, while searching for a rescue dog of our own, we were unexpectedly asked to foster. Our journey began with a family of 10 puppies &mdash; and while they played on our front lawn, passersby couldn&rsquo;t resist their charm.</p>
      <p style="opacity:.8;">After years of working with rescue organizations and placing hundreds of puppies, we made it official. In December 2022, Mission Bay Puppy Rescue became a 501(c)(3) nonprofit.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="media">
      <img src="https://missionbaypuppyrescue.org/cdn/shop/files/gray-white-pit-bull-type-puppy-blue-banner-mission-bay-rescue-partners-text_1024x1024.webp?v=1738512518" alt="A rescued puppy, part of the Mission Bay Puppy Rescue story">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section navy">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow on-dark" style="justify-content:center; display:flex;">MBPR By The Numbers</span>
    <h2 style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:30px;">30 Years Of Impact</h2>
    <div class="stat-strip">
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">30+</div><div class="label">Years Rescuing</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">2,000+</div><div class="label">Pups &amp; Mamas Placed</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">2022</div><div class="label">Became A 501(c)(3)</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">100%</div><div class="label">Foster-Based Care</div></div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center; opacity:.6; font-size:.82rem; margin-top:16px;">[DRAFT &mdash; confirm exact stats to publish]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section sand-deep">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">What We Do</span>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:30px;">From Rescue To Forever Home</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-4">
      <div class="resource-tile">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8.5c0-2 1.4-3.5 3-3.5.9 0 1.6.6 2 1 .8-.4 1.9-.6 3-.6s2.2.2 3 .6c.4-.4 1.1-1 2-1 1.6 0 3 1.5 3 3.5 0 1.3-.6 2.4-1.5 3l.5 2c.3 1.5-.7 3-2.3 3H8.3c-1.6 0-2.6-1.5-2.3-3l.5-2C5.6 10.9 5 9.8 5 8.5z"/><circle cx="9.5" cy="10.5" r=".6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="14.5" cy="10.5" r=".6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Orphaned Litters</h4>
        <p>Puppies stay together until at least 8 weeks old.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="resource-tile">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20s-7.5-4.6-9.5-9C1 7.5 3 4 6.5 4c2 0 3.4 1.2 4 2 .6-.8 2-2 4-2C18 4 20 7.5 18.5 11c-2 4.4-6.5 9-6.5 9z"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Pregnant Mamas &amp; Newborns</h4>
        <p>A safe, peaceful place to care for their puppies.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="resource-tile">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 9.5l10-10a3.5 3.5 0 015 5l-10 10a3.5 3.5 0 01-5-5z"/><path d="M13 4.5l6.5 6.5"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="1"/><circle cx="12.5" cy="12.5" r="1"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Medical Care</h4>
        <p>Vaccinations, microchipping, and spay/neuter for every pup.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="resource-tile">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 11.5L12 4l8 7.5"/><path d="M6 10v9h12v-9"/><path d="M10 19v-5h4v5"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Forever Families</h4>
        <p>Matched with loving homes, ready for the next chapter.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Meet The Humans</span>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:30px;">Behind Every Rescue</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="quote-card" style="text-align:center; align-items:center;">
        <div style="width:88px;height:88px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sand-deep); margin-bottom:6px;"></div>
        <h3 style="margin-bottom:0;">Jackie</h3>
        <div class="who">Founder</div>
        <p style="opacity:.7;">[DRAFT bio]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="quote-card" style="text-align:center; align-items:center;">
        <div style="width:88px;height:88px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sand-deep); margin-bottom:6px;"></div>
        <h3 style="margin-bottom:0;">Steve</h3>
        <div class="who">Co-Founder</div>
        <p style="opacity:.7;">[DRAFT bio]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="quote-card" style="text-align:center; align-items:center;">
        <div style="width:88px;height:88px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sand-deep); margin-bottom:6px;"></div>
        <h3 style="margin-bottom:0;">Kristin</h3>
        <div class="who">Web &amp; Data</div>
        <p style="opacity:.7;">[DRAFT bio]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center; opacity:.6; font-size:.82rem; margin-top:20px;">[DRAFT &mdash; confirm who to feature + titles]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section sand-deep">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">In The News</span>
      <h2>&ldquo;Mission Bay Puppy Rescue: Saving Dogs For 30 Years&rdquo;</h2>
      <p style="opacity:.8; margin-bottom:20px;">SDNews.com covered MBPR&rsquo;s long-standing history and the heart behind the mission.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://sdnews.com/mission-bay-puppy-rescue-saving-dogs-for-30-years/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the SDNews.com Article</a>
    </div>
    <div class="media">
      <img src="https://missionbaypuppyrescue.org/cdn/shop/files/black-white-puppy-floppy-ears-bright-eyes_1024x1024.webp?v=1738512467" alt="A Mission Bay Puppy Rescue puppy">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="text-align:center;">
  <div class="container">
    <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/donate">Support Our Mission</a>
  </div>
</section>
</MBPRLayout>